#: windows.cpp:174
msgid ""
"When this option is enabled, a window in the background will automatically "
"come to the front when the mouse pointer has been over it for some time."
msgstr ""
"Heger ev danan aktîv be, hema heger tu çendakî bi mişkokê xwe liser bimîne "
"wê ew pencerê li pişt jiber xwe ve bêne pêşçavan "

#: windows.cpp:176
msgid ""
"This is the delay after which the window that the mouse pointer is over will "
"automatically come to the front."
msgstr ""
"Evaya westaneka kurte ku li piştî wêde ew pencera ku mişkok liser wêye dê bê "
"pêşçavan."

#: windows.cpp:180
msgid ""
"When this option is enabled, your windows will be brought to the front when "
"you click somewhere into the window contents."
msgstr ""
"Heger ev danan aktîv be, wê pencerê dîne pêşçavan dema ku bi mişkokê li her "
"cihekê liser wî kirtekî bikî."

#: windows.cpp:185
msgid "Navigation"
msgstr "Navîgation"

#: windows.cpp:190
msgid "Walk through windows mode:"
msgstr "Rewşa çûn û hatinê di nav penceran de:"

#: windows.cpp:192
msgid "&KDE"
msgstr "&KDE"

#: windows.cpp:194
msgid "CD&E"
msgstr "CD&E"

#: windows.cpp:197
msgid ""
"Hold down the Alt key and press the Tab key repeatedly to walk through the "
"windows on the current desktop (the Alt+Tab combination can be "
"reconfigured). The two different modes mean:"
"<ul>"
"<li><b>KDE</b>: a nice widget is shown, displaying the icons of all windows "
"to walk through and the title of the currently selected one;"
"<li><b>CDE</b>: the focus is passed to a new window each time Tab is "
"pressed. No fancy widget.</li></ul>"
msgstr ""
"Pê li Tasta ALT bike û destê xwe li ser bihêl û dûbare pê li Tatsa Tabulator bixe, "
"jibo ku tu biçe û were di nav pencerên Desktop de û tu kari be wan aktîvbike. "
"(Heger ev option kar nekir naxwe Danana ALT+TAB hatîye gûhertin. Mana van "
"herdû  modean eve ku:"
"<ul>"
"<li><b>KDE:</b> Wê erdek pir ciwan û xweşik derkeve ya ku pêş te dike çi "
"Pencer yan serdêr hatine hilbijartin"
"<li><b>CDE:</b>"
"Hema ku tu li Tasta Tabulator bixe, Fokus her carê diçe pencerek din, sobald die. "
"Û ew erdê xweşşik nayête dîtin.</li></>"

#: windows.cpp:208
msgid "&Traverse windows on all desktops"
msgstr "Hemmi &pencerên desktop werçerxîne"

#: windows.cpp:212
msgid ""
"Leave this option disabled if you want to limit walking through windows to "
"the current desktop."
msgstr ""
"Vê dananê bihêle neaktîv, heger tu guhertina dinav penceran bi tenê jibo "
"Desktopa aktuell dixwaze."

#: windows.cpp:216
msgid "Desktop navi&gation wraps around"
msgstr "Jiberxwe ve &Navigationa dan û stendinê dike"

#: windows.cpp:219
msgid ""
"Enable this option if you want keyboard or electric border navigation beyond "
"an edge desktop to bring you to the desktop at the opposite edge."
msgstr ""
"Vê Dananê aktîvbike, heger tu bixwaze ku navigation ji desktopa li rexê din "
"bîne rexê li himberî wê."

#: windows.cpp:223
msgid "Popup desktop name on desktop &switch"
msgstr "Navê desktopê &nîşandike heger ew desktop hate guhertin"

#: windows.cpp:226
msgid ""
"Enable this option if you wish to see the current desktop name popup "
"whenever the current desktop is changed."
msgstr "Vê optionê aktîv bike, heger tu bixwaze navê desktopa tu liser kardiki bibîne."

#: windows.cpp:461
msgid "Shading"
msgstr "Barkerê penceran"

#: windows.cpp:463
msgid "Anima&te"
msgstr "Anî&mation"

#: windows.cpp:464
msgid ""
"Animate the action of reducing the window to its titlebar (shading) as well "
"as the expansion of a shaded window"
msgstr ""
"Penceran biçûk dike, bi tenê lista serdêr tê xuyakirin (Effekta Barkerêpenceran) û "
"Dîsapêşkirina wê dibe mîna Animationekê"

#: windows.cpp:467
msgid "&Enable hover"
msgstr "&Hover aktîv dike"

#: windows.cpp:477
msgid ""
"If Shade Hover is enabled, a shaded window will un-shade automatically when "
"the mouse pointer has been over the title bar for some time."
msgstr ""
"Heger \"Barekerê-penceran yên Automatîk\" aktîv be, wê ew pencera berkirî "
"bê xûya kirin, heger mişkok demeka kurt liser wî ma."

#: windows.cpp:480
msgid ""
"Sets the time in milliseconds before the window unshades when the mouse "
"pointer goes over the shaded window."
msgstr ""
"Katekê disazîne (bi Millisekundan), ku tîrê mişkokê liser pencera aktîvkirî bimîne ta ku"
"pencere biçûk bibe."

#: windows.cpp:491
msgid "Multiple Monitor Support"
msgstr "Alîkarî jibo bicîhkirina firepenceran"

#: windows.cpp:493
msgid "Enable multiple monitor support"
msgstr "Alîkarî jibo bicîhkirina firepenceran aktîvbike"

#: windows.cpp:494
msgid "Enable support for multiple monitors merged to form a single desktop."
msgstr "Alîkarî jibo bicîhkirina firepenceran aktîvbike ligel şêweya single desktop."

#: windows.cpp:496
msgid "Enable window resistance support"
msgstr "Berî alîkarî jibo weguhastina penceran bigire"

#: windows.cpp:497
msgid ""
"Turn on resistance when moving a window from one physical screen to the "
"other."
msgstr "Dema weguhastina pencerekî li monîtorekî jibo yekî din berî wê karê bigir."

#: windows.cpp:498
msgid "Enable window placement support"
msgstr "Alîkarî jibo bicîhkirina penceran aktîv dike"

#: windows.cpp:499
msgid ""
"This option opens new windows on the physical screen on which the cursor is "
"present."
msgstr "Ev Danan pencerek nuh liser monitorê vedike di cihê ku tîrê mişkokê neha li sere."

#: windows.cpp:500
msgid "Enable window maximize support"
msgstr "Alîkarî jibo mezinkirina penceran aktîv dike"

#: windows.cpp:501
msgid ""
"When this option is turned on, windows will only maximize up to the physical "
"screen size."
msgstr ""
"Dema ku ev Danan aktîv be, pencer kari tenê bi firehkirina endaza desktopê "
"bête mezinkirin."

#: windows.cpp:505
msgid "Active Desktop Borders"
msgstr "Çarçêwên desktopa aktîv"

#: windows.cpp:508
msgid ""
"If this option is enabled, moving the mouse to a screen border will change "
"your desktop. This is e.g. useful if you want to drag windows from one "
"desktop to the other."
msgstr ""
"Heger ev danan aktîv be, wê gavê birina tîrê mişkokê jibo ser rexê screen ê "
"desktopa diguhrîne. Evaya zor çake heger tu bixwaze penceran ji "
"desktopekê bibe desktopeka din (Yanî tu wana bibe û bîne)."

#: windows.cpp:511
msgid "D&isabled"
msgstr "&Likarxistin"

#: windows.cpp:512
msgid "Only &when moving windows"
msgstr "&Bitenê aktîv bike dema weguhastina penceran"

#: windows.cpp:513
msgid "A&lways enabled"
msgstr "&Herdem aktîv bike"

#: windows.cpp:518
msgid "Desktop &switch delay:"
msgstr "Demarawistanê bo çûn û hatin dinav &desktopa de:"

#: windows.cpp:519
msgid ""
"Here you can set a delay for switching desktops using the active borders "
"feature. Desktops will be switched after the mouse has been pushed against a "
"screen border for the specified number of milliseconds."
msgstr ""
"Livir tu kari dema(kata)-rawistandinê jibo funktionên \"Bordera aktîv\" sazbike. "
"Hew wê çaxê diçe ser desktopeke din heger tîrê mişkokê cendakî(li gor te "
"çend Millisekunde danîne) liser Bord a Skrînê ma û ne livî."

#: windows.cpp:682
msgid "Windows"
msgstr "Pencere"

#: windows.cpp:691
msgid "Di&splay content in moving windows"
msgstr "Naweroka penceran ligel &cûlankirinê nîşanbide"

#: windows.cpp:693
msgid ""
"Enable this option if you want a window's content to be fully shown while "
"moving it, instead of just showing a window 'skeleton'. The result may not "
"be satisfying on slow machines without graphic acceleration."
msgstr ""
"Enable this option if you want a window's content to be fully shown while "
"moving it, instead of just showing a window 'skeleton'. The result may not "
"be satisfying on slow machines without graphic acceleration."

#: windows.cpp:697
msgid "Display content in &resizing windows"
msgstr "Naweropka penceran ligel &guhertina endazê wane nîşanbide"

#: windows.cpp:699
msgid ""
"Enable this option if you want a window's content to be shown while resizing "
"it, instead of just showing a window 'skeleton'. The result may not be "
"satisfying on slow machines."
msgstr ""
"Vê Dananê aktîvbike heger tu bixwaze ku nawerokê pencerê komplet bêne xuyakirin, "
"heger te guhertin di endaza pencerê kir.Yanî ne bi tenê perçak ji wan."
"Ev option jibo PC-ê yên kevin ne başe jiber ku tawdana karên grafîk jêre pêwîste."

#: windows.cpp:703
msgid "Display window &geometry when moving or resizing"
msgstr "&Geometrîya penceran nîşanbide heger endazê wana hat guhertin."

#: windows.cpp:705
msgid ""
"Enable this option if you want a window's geometry to be displayed while it "
"is being moved or resized. The window position relative to the top-left "
"corner of the screen is displayed together with its size."
msgstr ""
"Vê optionê aktîv bike heger tu bixwaze geometîya pencerê bibîne dema tu "
"wê diculînî yan endaza wî diguhrînî. Pencere diçe ser jûr rexê çepê "
"ji skrînê(screen) û tev mezinbuna xwe tê xuyakirin."

#: windows.cpp:715
msgid "Animate minimi&ze and restore"
msgstr "Anîmekirina &biçûkkirinê û enbar kirinê"

#: windows.cpp:717
msgid ""
"Enable this option if you want an animation shown when windows are minimized "
"or restored."
msgstr ""
"Vê dananê aktîv bike heger tu Anîmationê dixwaze bibîne dema pencere "
"biçûk dibin yan ji dên enbar kirinê."

#: windows.cpp:731
msgid "Slow"
msgstr "Hêdî"

#: windows.cpp:735
msgid "Fast"
msgstr "Bilez"

#: windows.cpp:739
msgid ""
"Here you can set the speed of the animation shown when windows are minimized "
"and restored. "
msgstr ""
"Livir tu kari saz bike, ku anîmation cendî divê bilez be, dema pencere "
"biçûk dibin yan ji dên enbar kirinê."

#: windows.cpp:745
msgid "Allow moving and resizing o&f maximized windows"
msgstr "Destûr dide ku pencere bên &cûlankirin yan na, dema tu wan biçûk û mezin dike"

#: windows.cpp:747
msgid ""
"When enabled, this feature activates the border of maximized windows and "
"allows you to move or resize them, just like for normal windows"
msgstr ""
"Ev Funktion destûr dide ku ew pencerên mezin bune gellekî normal bêne "
"cûlankirin yan mezinbuna wan bê guhertin."

#: windows.cpp:753
msgid "&Placement:"
msgstr "&bicîhkirin:"

#: windows.cpp:756
msgid "Smart"
msgstr "Smart"

#: windows.cpp:757
msgid "Cascade"
msgstr "Cascade"

#: windows.cpp:758
msgid "Random"
msgstr "Helkewt"

#: windows.cpp:759
msgid "Centered"
msgstr "Navendbuyî"

#: windows.cpp:760
msgid "Zero-Cornered"
msgstr "Di kûjîya 0,0 de"

#: windows.cpp:767
msgid ""
"The placement policy determines where a new window will appear on the "
"desktop. For now, there are three different policies: "
"<ul>"
"<li><em>Smart</em> will try to achieve a minimum overlap of windows</li> "
"<li><em>Cascade</em> will cascade the windows</li> "
"<li><em>Random</em> will use a random position</li></ul>"
msgstr ""
"Policy ya Bigîhkirinê sazdike, ku Pecer li çiderê ji Desktopê "
"divê xuyabike dema tu wê vediki. Neha 3 Option hene: "
"<ul>"
"<li><em>Smart</em> Ev penceran bi kêmanî dûranîya wan liser hev datîne</li> "
"<li><em>Cascade</em>Evaya liser û bin hev wan datîne</li> "
"<li><em>Random</em> Evaya bicîhkirinekê nenas bikartîne</li></ul>"

#: windows.cpp:799
msgid "Snap Zones"
msgstr "Zone ya Snap"

#: windows.cpp:803 windows.cpp:813
msgid "none"
msgstr "Nîne"

#: windows.cpp:805
msgid "&Border snap zone:"
msgstr "&Zone ya Boarder Snap:"

#: windows.cpp:806 windows.cpp:816
msgid " pixels"
msgstr " pîksil"

#: windows.cpp:808
msgid ""
"Here you can set the snap zone for screen borders, i.e. the 'strength' of "
"the magnetic field which will make windows snap to the border when moved "
"near it."
msgstr ""
"Livir tu kari Zone ya Snap jibo Border yên Skrînê sazbike, yanî "
" \"Xurtîya xana pola\", evaya pencerê di Border de digre û diwestîne"
", heger evana nêzîkî wê bun."

#: windows.cpp:815
msgid "&Window snap zone:"
msgstr "&Zone ya Snap ya penceran:"

#: windows.cpp:818
msgid ""
"Here you can set the snap zone for windows, i.e. the 'strength' of the "
"magnetic field which will make windows snap to each other when they're moved "
"near another window."
msgstr ""
"Livir tu kari Zone ya Snap jibo Borderê penceran sazbike, yanî "
" \"Xurtîya xana pola\", evaya pencerê digre û nahêle here ser pencerê din, heger "
"nêzîkî hinek din bu."

#: windows.cpp:822
msgid "Snap windows onl&y when overlapping"
msgstr "Penceran snap dike &heger ew hatin ser hev"

#: windows.cpp:823
msgid ""
"Here you can set that windows will be only snapped if you try to overlap "
"them, i.e. they won't be snapped if the windows comes only near another "
"window or border."
msgstr ""
"Livir tu kari  sazbike, ku pencer wêçaxê Snap bibin, dema ku ew biçin ser "
"hev. Yanî ew naçin ser hev heger pencer nêzîkî hev bun."

